diff --git a/changelog/69890.added.md b/changelog/69890.added.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e2d03fe
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/69890.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added support for a ``minimum`` usage threshold to the ``diskusage`` beacon, alongside the existing ``maximum`` (previously the only, implicit, threshold). A beacon fires when usage drops to or below ``minimum``, which helps catch a mount whose filesystem silently failed to mount and now shows the near-empty backing directory. Configure it with a mapping instead of a bare percentage, e.g. ``/mnt/nfs: {minimum: 10%, maximum: 90%}``; existing bare-percentage configuration is unaffected and continues to behave as a ``maximum``-only check.
